WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.417
Long queues. Lost files. Confusing bills. Sound familiar?

2
00:00:05.097 --> 00:00:08.362
Meet Astra Pulse. One simple app to run your whole hospital.

3
00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:12.188
At the front desk, a new patient is registered in seconds.

4
00:00:12.868 --> 00:00:15.771
Patients book online, and see their turn on their phone.

5
00:00:16.568 --> 00:00:19.441
The doctor sees the patient's full history on one screen.

6
00:00:20.268 --> 00:00:24.590
Test results, like sugar and cholesterol, go straight to the patient's phone.

7
00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:29.208
The doctor sets a treatment plan, and the app sends follow-up reminders.

8
00:00:29.888 --> 00:00:34.230
For pregnant mothers, every check-up and scan is tracked, right up to delivery.

9
00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:39.282
Children's vaccines are tracked, and parents get a reminder before each dose.

10
00:00:39.962 --> 00:00:44.736
The pharmacy gets the prescription instantly, and stock is re-ordered before it runs out.

11
00:00:45.416 --> 00:00:49.830
Nurses see which beds are free, and cleaning staff get their tasks automatically.

12
00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:53.710
When an ambulance is on the way, the emergency team is ready.

13
00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:59.428
Patients can pay by cash, card, or UPI, like Google Pay or Paytm.

14
00:01:00.108 --> 00:01:03.882
And as the owner, you can see everything, live, from anywhere.

15
00:01:04.562 --> 00:01:10.578
It works in your language too: Tamil, Hindi, Malayalam, Telugu, Kannada, and more.

16
00:01:11.258 --> 00:01:15.366
Astra Pulse. Your hospital, made simple. Book a free demo today.
